==============================================================================
Q0  thresholds: irrationality (d = 1) and non-quadraticity (d = 2), 2-adic transcription of KRVZ
==============================================================================
  C_cyc = 5/54 - Im Li2(e^(2 pi i/3))/(pi^2 sqrt3) = 0.05301135   (Im Li2 = 0.676627737606)
  per n^3: 2-adic gain (7/3) L; clearing 4/3 log2 M0 per archimedean conjugate; forced divisor kappa log2 M0
  theta, no divisor              : d=1 mu_bar < 1.75000;  d=2 mu_bar < 0.87500;  d=3 mu_bar < 0.58333
  theta, + q-order (Prop. 2)     : d=1 mu_bar < 2.54545;  d=2 mu_bar < 1.27273;  d=3 mu_bar < 0.84848
  theta, + cyclotomic (Prop. 4)  : d=1 mu_bar < 2.87837;  d=2 mu_bar < 1.43919;  d=3 mu_bar < 0.95946
  closed form c_NQ = 126 pi^2/(79 pi^2 + 72 sqrt3 Im Li2) = 1.439185
  dictionary: KRVZ Thm 1 (lambda = 0) gamma > 3.27694461 (they print 3.27694460); gamma/(gamma-1) = 1.439185
  d = 3 would need mu_bar < 0.9595 < 1: as in KRVZ (5.11), only d = 1, 2 are reachable.
  Euler, no divisor              : d=1 mu_bar < 1.50000;  d=2 mu_bar < 0.75000
  Euler, + q-order (Prop. 1)     : d=1 mu_bar < 2.00000;  d=2 mu_bar < 1.00000
  Euler, + cyclotomic (Prop. 4)  : d=1 mu_bar < 2.23719;  d=2 mu_bar < 1.11860
  dictionary: KRVZ Thm 1 (lambda != 0) gamma > 9.43194241 (they print 9.43194241); gamma/(gamma-1) = 1.118597
  3x+1 Y3 rho = 2^10/3^9          : mu_bar = 1.42647 -> theta not quadratic: True
  5x+1 HYP-9131 rho = 2^33/5^23   : mu_bar = 1.61831 -> theta not quadratic: False
  3x+1 2^8/3^7                    : mu_bar = 1.38684 -> theta not quadratic: True
  5x+1 2^5/5^3                    : mu_bar = 1.39316 -> theta not quadratic: True
  7x+1 2^2/7                      : mu_bar = 1.40368 -> theta not quadratic: True

